Bind cached output records, lookups, MCP resource reads, HTTP retrieval URLs and any search caches to user ownership and applicable grants. Decide explicit compatibility for signed bearer cache URLs; default owner-private retrieval must not silently become cross-user access. Namespace resource identifiers and redact logs. Acceptance: guessed IDs, copied links under another identity, stale/revoked grants and same-name resources cannot leak data; bounded-output behavior remains intact.
